  "te": "No.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.64,
  "boundary_margin": 9.9,
  "confidence": "check"
 },
 {
  "line": 141,
  "start": 397.733,
  "end": 400.792,
  "te": "It means nobody has proven our system at sea yet.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.17,
  "boundary_margin": 2.067,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 142,
  "start": 401.171,
  "end": 403.954,
  "te": "Look at it from both sides, and the trap becomes clear.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.92,
  "boundary_margin": 0.165,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 143,
  "start": 404.341,
  "end": 408.497,
  "te": "The Navy can't bet a war submarine on an engine that has never been to sea.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.03,
  "boundary_margin": 0.165,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 144,
  "start": 408.903,
  "end": 412.907,
  "te": "And the engine can't go to sea until a submarine is cut open for it.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.09,
  "boundary_margin": 0.389,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 145,
  "start": 413.267,
  "end": 413.973,
  "te": "Both are right.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.88,
  "boundary_margin": 1.711,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 146,
  "start": 414.413,
  "end": 415.502,
  "te": "That's what makes it a trap.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.78,
  "boundary_margin": 9.9,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 147,
  "start": 415.992,
  "end": 417.709,
  "te": "And there's one more lock on that trap.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.86,
  "boundary_margin": 0.859,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 148,
  "start": 418.189,
  "end": 423.758,
  "te": "A submarine can only be cut open in a big refit, when it leaves service for months of repair.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.05,
  "boundary_margin": 0.74,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 149,
  "start": 424.125,
  "end": 426.367,
  "te": "And that comes once in several years.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.12,
  "boundary_margin": 0.74,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 150,
  "start": 426.861,
  "end": 428.656,
  "te": "So what happened in twenty twenty-five?",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.84,
  "boundary_margin": 9.9,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 151,
  "start": 429.151,
  "end": 432.016,
  "te": "India's first Kalvari boat was in for its refit.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.13,
  "boundary_margin": 0.646,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
