  "start": 473.39,
  "end": 477.986,
  "te": "And the plan is to give it to all six Kalvari boats, one refit at a time.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.08,
  "boundary_margin": 0.223,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 166,
  "start": 478.47,
  "end": 480.204,
  "te": "Meanwhile, is the sea waiting?",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.92,
  "boundary_margin": 0.223,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 167,
  "start": 480.767,
  "end": 481.033,
  "te": "No.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.99,
  "boundary_margin": 2.364,
  "confidence": "check"
 },
 {
  "line": 168,
  "start": 481.525,
  "end": 484.847,
  "te": "China's Yuan class submarines already have this technology.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.94,
  "boundary_margin": 0.215,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 169,
  "start": 485.307,
  "end": 492.652,
  "te": "In April twenty twenty-six, Pakistan commissioned its first Hangor class submarine, which its navy says has A-I-P too.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.97,
  "boundary_margin": 0.215,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 170,
  "start": 493.161,
  "end": 497.748,
  "te": "So everything you've heard now rests on one boat, and one set of trials.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.07,
  "boundary_margin": 0.217,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 171,
  "start": 498.217,
  "end": 502.141,
  "te": "If those trials work, India will have what no tender can turn down.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.0,
  "boundary_margin": 0.149,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
